    "display_name": "Polish the Style",
    "long_instructions": "# Polish the Style\r\n\r\n**Your Task:** With the help of AI, improve the button, links, and their hover/focus styles so they feel on-brand and easy to use.\r\n- Don't forget to ensure the page still meets usability standards.\r\n- Before saving your changes, resize the preview to check how the page looks on smaller screens. If text overlaps or elements stop fitting, refine your CSS to improve readability.\r\n\r\n### Plan Before You Prompt\r\n\r\nBefore you ask AI to make changes, write:\r\n- **Goal:** What exactly are you improving?\r\n- **Constraints:** What must stay true to your brand and readability?\r\n- **Edge cases:** What could go wrong if AI overdoes it?\r\n\r\nMake one request at a time (one area, one change), then preview before asking for the next change.\r\n\r\n:::details [Need Help Prompting AI]\r\nIf you would like help crafting your AI prompt or deciding whether to accept, revise, or reject the output generated by AI, you can refer to the [Prompting Playbook](https://studio.code.org/docs/ide/prompting-playbook).\r\n:::",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Improve the buttons, links, and hover styles so they feel on-brand and easy to use.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/9b2759fd37b4056b6d97792dd2693353-color-palette.png",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Loop — Student Startup Landing Page</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n  <a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <div class=\"container header-inner\">\n      <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#home\" aria-label=\"Loop home\">\n        <span class=\"logo\" aria-hidden=\"true\">◯</span>\n        <span class=\"brand-name\">Loop</span>\n      </a>\n\n      <nav class=\"primary-nav\" aria-label=\"Primary\">\n        <ul class=\"nav\">\n          <li><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#features\">Features</a></li>\n          <li><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#stories\">Stories</a></li>\n          <li><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#pricing\">Pricing</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </nav>\n\n      <div class=\"header-cta\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"#signin\">Sign in</a>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"#signup\">Get Started</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main id=\"main\">\n    <!-- HERO -->\n    <section class=\"hero container\" id=\"home\">\n      <div class=\"hero-grid\">\n        <div class=\"hero-copy\">\n          <h1>Group projects, finally organized.</h1>\n          <p class=\"lede\">\n            Loop is a simple hub for teams at school — share tasks, track progress,\n            and keep everything in one place.\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"actions\">\n            <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"#signup\">Create a free workspace</a>\n            <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"#demo\">See a quick demo</a>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"micro-note\">No credit card required • Free for students</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hero-media\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <img\n            src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/loopdash/900/540\"\n            alt=\"\"\n            class=\"hero-img\"\n          />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- FEATURES -->\n    <section class=\"features container\" id=\"features\" aria-label=\"Features\">\n      <h2>Everything you need to ship on time</h2>\n      <div class=\"card-grid\">\n        <article class=\"card\">\n          <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/tasks/640/360\" alt=\"Task list preview\" />\n          <h3>Tasks & Checklists</h3>\n          <p>Break big projects into steps. Assign owners and due dates.</p>\n          <a class=\"inline-link\" href=\"#learn-tasks\">Learn more</a>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\">Try it</button>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"card\">\n          <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/chat/640/360\" alt=\"Chat bubbles illustration\" />\n          <h3>Focus Chat</h3>\n          <p>Keep project talk in one place — no more lost threads.</p>\n          <a class=\"inline-link\" href=\"#learn-chat\">Learn more</a>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\">Try it</button>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"card\">\n          <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/files/640/360\" alt=\"Files and folders illustration\" />\n          <h3>Files, All Together</h3>\n          <p>Docs, slides, and links — organized by group and class.</p>\n          <a class=\"inline-link\" href=\"#learn-files\">Learn more</a>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\">Try it</button>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- STORIES -->\n    <section class=\"stories container\" id=\"stories\" aria-label=\"Student stories\">\n      <h2>Students are finishing faster</h2>\n      <blockquote class=\"quote\">\n        “We planned our robotics build in Loop and finished a week early.\n        Tasks + chat in one place = no chaos.”\n        <cite>— Maya T., Robotics Club</cite>\n      </blockquote>\n\n      <p>\n        Curious how teams use Loop? Check out our <a class=\"inline-link\" href=\"#blog\">blog</a>\n        for real student workflows and templates.\n      </p>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- PRICING / CTA -->\n    <section class=\"pricing container\" id=\"pricing\" aria-label=\"Pricing\">\n      <h2>Start free. Upgrade when you’re ready.</h2>\n      <div class=\"pricing-cta\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"#signup\">Get Started</a>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"#contact\">Contact us</a>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"micro-note\">Student plan includes 3 workspaces and unlimited collaborators.</p>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n    <div class=\"container footer-inner\">\n      <p>© 2025 Loop — a student-built project platform</p>\n      <nav aria-label=\"Footer\">\n        <ul class=\"nav footer-nav\">\n          <li><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#privacy\">Privacy</a></li>\n          <li><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#terms\">Terms</a></li>\n          <li><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#support\">Support</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "styles.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nhtml,\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n  color: #1f2937;\n  background: #f4f5f8;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n\nimg {\n  max-width: 100%;\n  display: block;\n}\n\nh1,\nh2,\nh3 {\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n}\n\np {\n  margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n}\n\n.skip-link {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: -9999px;\n}\n\n.skip-link:focus {\n  left: 16px;\n  top: 16px;\n  background: black;\n  color: white;\n  padding: 8px 12px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n.container {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 1080px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 0 16px;\n}\n\n.site-header {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n}\n\n.header-inner {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr auto auto;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 16px;\n  padding: 16px 0;\n}\n\n.brand {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  color: #1f2937;\n  font-weight: 800;\n}\n\n.logo {\n  color: #6c5ce7;\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n}\n\n.brand-name {\n  letter-spacing: 0.3px;\n}\n\n.nav {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 16px;\n  list-style: none;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n.nav-link {\n  text-decoration: none;\n  color: #1f2937;\n  padding: 6px 8px;\n}\n\n.nav-link:hover {\n  background: #f0f0f0;\n}\n\n.hero {\n  padding: 32px 0;\n}\n\n.hero-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;\n  gap: 32px;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.hero-copy .lede {\n  color: #6b7280;\n  font-size: 1.05rem;\n}\n\n.actions {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  margin-top: 16px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.micro-note {\n  color: #6b7280;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  margin-top: 8px;\n}\n\n.hero-img {\n  border-radius: 8px;\n}\n\n.features {\n  padding: 32px 0;\n}\n\n.card-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));\n  gap: 24px;\n  margin-top: 24px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card h3 {\n  margin-top: 12px;\n}\n\n.card p {\n  color: #6b7280;\n}\n\n.card .btn {\n  margin-top: 8px;\n}\n\n.stories {\n  padding: 32px 0;\n}\n\n.quote {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  padding: 16px;\n  font-style: italic;\n}\n\n.pricing {\n  padding: 32px 0;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.pricing-cta {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  margin-top: 12px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.site-footer {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  margin-top: 32px;\n}\n\n.footer-inner {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  padding: 16px 0;\n  gap: 16px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.footer-nav .nav-link {\n  color: #6b7280;\n}\n\n.inline-link {\n  color: #6c5ce7;\n  text-decoration: none;\n}\n\n.inline-link:hover {\n  text-decoration: underline;\n}\n\n.inline-link:visited {\n  color: #6c5ce7;\n}\n\n.btn {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 10px 14px;\n  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  background: #ffffff;\n  color: #1f2937;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.btn-primary {\n  background: #6c5ce7;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid #6c5ce7;\n}\n\n.btn-primary:hover {\n  background: #5a4bd1;\n  border-color: #5a4bd1;\n}\n\n.btn-secondary {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  color: #6c5ce7;\n  border: 1px solid #6c5ce7;\n}\n\n.btn-secondary:hover {\n  background: #f0f0f0;\n}\n\n.btn-ghost {\n  background: transparent;\n  color: #1f2937;\n  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n}\n\n.btn-ghost:hover {\n  background: #f0f0f0;\n}\n\n.btn:focus {\n  outline: 1px dotted #999;\n  outline-offset: 1px;\n}\n\n.btn:disabled,\n.btn[aria-disabled=\"true\"] {\n  opacity: 0.6;\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .header-inner {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n\n  .hero-grid {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n\n  .nav {\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "2"
      ]
    },
